WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:08.180
I can reproduce exactly what 
I had happen back then.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.380
What's that?

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:26.550
I don't know.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:41.140
Biscuit Sirius will secure an 
escape route for the students.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:44.600
Direct hit!

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.310
I can't believe the O'bli have 
appeared in our world.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.280
Leave the support to Coconut Vega.

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:53.680
What's going on?

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.370
This is really bad!

00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:58.120
Everyone, watch out.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.710
If we take damage in this world, 
we might be in real trouble.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:05.510
So that means we could die in 
the worst case scenario, right?

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:07.560
Keep it together!

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:11.260
Even if that's possible, it doesn't 
change what we need to do!

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:14.100
We fight and save this world!

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:17.100
Four additional O'bli have appeared, moshu.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:20.430
Don't let the O'bli get outside the base!

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:23.600
I never would have expected 
them to attack the school.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:25.640
They're after Eterno, moshu.

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:27.000
I'd imagine so.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:31.280
If this becomes a battle of attrition in 
the real world, with nowhere to run to,

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:34.280
Fifth Force won't stand a chance, moshu.

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:36.760
If that happens...

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:41.670
It's possible that I didn't 
come from another world...

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:45.000
Not from another world... 
She couldn't mean...

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:48.250
We have to find Morgana, no matter the cost,

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:49.980
and defeat her.

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:51.130
Or we'll...

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:54.560
No, this entire world will...

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:00.240
<b>Final Battle! Fifth Force Forever</b>

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.600
She brought O'bli to the real world?

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:08.690
It's the same as before...

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:10.840
This world...

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:12.860
Yes.

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:16.310
I can't let you get away with this!

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:22.780
I wanted to see how you'd react

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:30.080
if I created the same 
circumstances as before.

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:34.590
Miyama Tsubame-san,

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:38.760
will you travel to the past and 
replay everything, like before?

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:51.260
Be serious!

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:53.480
<i>I'll never...</i>

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.690
<i>let that happen...</i>

00:02:58.300 --> 00:02:59.760
<i>or feel that...</i>

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.460
<i>again!</i>

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:07.160
<i>She's reading all my moves.</i>

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:08.880
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:52.710
What is this?

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.760
It's the O'bli we fished out of 
that lake in the boundary.

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:58.880
You caught an O'bli?

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.870
It looked like a fish, so...

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:02.940
We made a fish print of it.

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:05.590
Who would have thought 
this would come in handy?

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:11.000
This type is different from 
the ones we controlled.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.890
It must be a single production by Morgana.

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:18.150
That's why it smells just like she did 
when I went after her before.

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:19.530
It smells?

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:22.490
It has its own sort of waves that it emits.

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:25.570
All right. Let's go.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:26.250
Huh?

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:27.320
You know where to go?

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:29.240
We don't have time.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.290
Don't just stand there!

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:32.170
Right.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:37.650
While we're just standing here, 
the other teams are risking their lives.

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:45.560
The coordinates that Odile-san 
specified aren't in our map.

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:47.390
It's an unknown dimension.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:50.020
Please be careful.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:51.270
And no matter what...

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:53.930
No matter what...

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:56.490
We know, Sensei.

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:58.730
Bring back Tsubame.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.360
And we'll all...

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.670
...come back...

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:03.070
...with a smile.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.560
We'll go, too.

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:05.300
Yeah.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:06.300
Let's go!

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:11.640
As long as the Knight of the 
Black Swan is with you,

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:13.660
we won't let her continue to have her way.

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:16.000
Beginning transport, moshu.

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.560
What is this place?

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:37.780
It's not the boundary where we 
always fight, that's for sure.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:38.900
Indeed.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.570
Where are we?

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:43.000
We've never seen this place, either.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.030
If we had, we'd have told you guys already.

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:47.400
It's dangerous here.

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:48.380
Huh?

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:49.910
Something's here.

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:54.470
Is that...

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:55.660
An O'bli?

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.460
Look at that!

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:03.050
T-Tsubame!

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:07.630
The dimensional distortions...

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.050
...are increasing!

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:12.010
We won't be able to handle them all.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.430
They just keep coming.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:18.510
Damn it, there's no end to them!

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:21.230
Take this!

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:32.000
Lady Niho.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.200
You saved us.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.040
No problem.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.040
It was no big deal.

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:37.250
I've evacuated all the students.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:40.000
Now we can go all-out.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.170
Let's go!

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:47.890
Why is Tsubame-chin all the way up there?!

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:49.140
Tsubame-chan!

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:50.410
Tsubame!

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:52.220
It looks like she's unconscious.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:54.970
Tsubame-chin!

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:58.640
We'll have to go up there and take it out.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.260
Watch out!

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:16.300
Wh-What was that attack?

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.750
We'll draw her attention.
Make your move then.

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:20.670
I'll back you up, as well!

00:07:23.610 --> 00:07:24.420
Let us go.

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:25.670
Got it!

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:28.880
Let's go.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.420
Hina! Koori!

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:50.990
Nice!

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:54.410
Let's go!

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:01.830
From behind us, too?!

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:09.860
Now!

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:13.840
They're there!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:14.720
All right!

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:17.360
Tsubame!

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.660
Tsubame-chan, we're here to save you!

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:21.640
Tsubame, come on!

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:22.520
Run!

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:40.090
Are you okay?!

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:42.030
What's with her?

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:44.670
It might be hiding other weapons.

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:47.630
We have to approach with care.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.580
Wait, what about Morgana?

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:53.340
I don't see her.

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:55.580
She's here.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:00.510
Here?

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:01.810
Where?

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:04.060
She's...

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:07.050
inside the O'bli.

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.660
You're suspending the research?

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:24.250
Professor Isami, are you serious?

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:29.960
I built this orphanage to help 
grow the children's potential,

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:34.650
but the top brass only see 
the children as lab rats.

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:38.560
That potential of theirs, the Fifth Particle,

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:41.180
will bring new evolution to mankind.

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:44.550
We've already confirmed that, as well.

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:45.930
Your own—

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:45.930
Stop it.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:48.780
That was pure coincidence.

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:50.410
It wasn't intentional.

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:52.650
In any event, the research is suspended.

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:54.780
No, it's being completely erased.

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.200
What are you doing, Professor Orie?!

00:09:57.620 --> 00:10:03.870
I want to see the depths of the 
unknown power of the Fifth Particle.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.310
Don't be ridiculous!

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:09.560
If someone incompatible bathes in the 
Fifth Particle and it goes out of control,

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:14.130
you'll be bound to forever wander through 
space-time... You'll become Morgana!

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:15.710
Morgana...

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:19.260
That might be good.

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.490
Are you being serious?!

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:25.060
To wander through space-time 
and seek the limits of reason...

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:29.160
That's not a bad choice for a scientist.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:29.980
Stop it!

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:32.350
Stop it right now, Professor Orie!

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:35.410
Professor Orie!

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:53.780
<i>These... aren't my memories.</i>

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:57.840
<i>This was from back when I was still human.</i>

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:02.090
<i>My memories before I became Morgana.</i>

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:06.920
<i>Morgana is that someone 
who wanders space-time.</i>

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:11.400
<i>Yes, and you as well, 
since you traveled to the past.</i>

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:13.580
<i>That might be true.</i>

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:17.070
<i>I'm not part of this world.</i>

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:19.510
<i>That's very funny.</i>

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:23.530
<i>You're willing to admit you've gotten 
special powers from the Fifth Particle,</i>

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:26.950
<i>but unwilling to acknowledge 
any more than that.</i>

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:28.890
<i>No.</i>

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:30.840
<i>I'm just a normal human.</i>

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:34.540
<i>I just didn't want to give up, no matter what.</i>

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:39.920
<i>No normal human can travel 
to the past just by wishing it.</i>

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:45.430
<i>There's still more reason to study you.</i>

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:46.970
<i>But before that...</i>

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:51.730
Morgana's inside the O'bli?

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:54.390
I've been wondering this for a while,

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:57.540
but why did Morgana need you three?

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:58.480
Need?

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.660
If she has that much power,

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:03.490
she shouldn't need to take 
such elaborate measures.

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:09.820
Morgana can only be in the normal 
world when she's in human form.

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:12.460
That's why she was using us and the O'bli.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:14.630
Human form? What do you mean?

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:18.710
There was that female physics 
teacher at the school, right?

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:21.940
Oh, Orie-sensei was her name, right?

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:23.580
The one that seemed kinda "airy."

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:26.220
The one that transferred 
to another school so fast.

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:27.810
That's Morgana.

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:29.360
What?!

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:32.060
She infiltrated the school 
to find Tsubame-san.

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:37.000
So she left the school because 
she accomplished her goal, huh?

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:41.900
You're all quite interesting.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:45.360
Morgana!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.140
I know it's sudden,

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:50.240
but Akara-san, Hina-san, Koori-san...

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:52.250
Defeat these other girls for me.

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:54.940
What are you saying?

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:56.590
Akara-chin and the others aren't...

00:12:56.590 --> 00:12:58.310
Morgana-sama...

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:02.460
Akara-chin, Hina-chin, Koori-chin...

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:04.650
We were...

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:07.760
...raised by Morgana-sama this whole time.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:11.940
Morgana-sama saved our lives.

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:20.180
You're so annoying!

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:25.450
The Knight of the Black Swan, 
Odile, is going to defeat you!

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:27.780
You again?

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:32.050
I didn't think it could be true, but you're...

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:53.580
Let me go!

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:59.980
I'll need to make you be my lab rat, too.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:01.980
Let her go!

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:04.610
Sacchan is my precious friend!

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:06.700
Hina-san...

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:13.020
You're going to take up arms against me,

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:14.830
the one who saved your lives?

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.810
Our real savior...

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:20.290
No, our precious friends...

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.710
are the people who treated 
us as human beings.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.340
The people from this world,

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:28.380
and the ones who put their 
lives on the line to save us!

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.710
She's one of them, too!

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:32.390
Right?

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:33.330
Yeah.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:34.660
Akara-chin!

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:35.580
Hina-chin!

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:36.600
Koori-chin!

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:40.040
Morgana, no matter what you try to do,

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:42.280
we only want one thing.

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:44.740
To save our precious friends!

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:45.540
Yeah!

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:48.070
We're going to save our world!

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:50.110
Very well...

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:08.970
Want one thing...

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:12.680
When you release your true feelings,

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:15.700
you'll be able to use your true power.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:19.890
That is the natural order of the 
world that you must correct.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:23.040
Release my true feelings...

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.640
I see!

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:27.150
So that's what it is!

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:29.900
I don't... I don't...

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:32.110
need this anymore!

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:43.760
That crazy power...

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.350
That's Professor Isami for you...

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:55.180
Yes, you were another possibility 
I was hoping for back then.

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:58.180
It's fate that we met here.

00:15:57.270 --> 00:15:58.180
Shut up!

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:00.650
That's amazing.

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:01.820
Sacchan...

00:16:01.820 --> 00:16:03.510
All right, now!

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:04.670
Right!

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:05.900
This should be close enough!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.010
We did it!

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:20.620
Thanks for your help, Koori-chan!

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.840
Will you make it for me again?

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:27.880
Your pork cutlet bowl?

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:29.880
Sure!

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:32.250
Anytime is fine!

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:37.890
You two, I'd like some, as well.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:42.390
Sacchan!

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:44.020
Thank you!

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:48.430
I'll provide support.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:51.100
You two save Tsubame-san!

00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:51.940
Roger!

00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:51.940
Leave it to us!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.220
<i>Everyone's fighting for me.</i>

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:59.740
<i>Yes... I wished it from the bottom of my heart.</i>

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:02.410
<i>That I would never give up.</i>

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:07.220
<i>That I would save the world, 
and my wonderful friends.</i>

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:08.140
Io?

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:12.380
<i>That's why I'm...</i>

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:16.040
<i>not Morgana!</i>

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:24.810
Are you okay?

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:27.430
Thank you, Akara...san.

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:28.730
Akara's fine.

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:31.980
Tsubame-chan!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.050
Tsubame-chin!

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:34.240
Tsubame-san!

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:35.840
You guys...

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:37.220
Akara-san and the others, too?

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:38.660
You all came to save me?

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:41.290
We could say the same to you.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:43.990
Thanks for doing this for me and my sisters.

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:47.080
We don't have time to stand around!

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:50.090
We need to defeat her now.

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:51.460
Right.

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:57.800
We're going to use all of 
Torte's power to make a path.

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:58.700
Got it.

00:17:58.700 --> 00:17:59.600
Roger.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.660
Tanaka-san and everyone else, 
please provide backup.

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:07.790
Io, let's go!

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:09.690
Our finishing move.

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:11.750
Sure. Okay!

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:20.070
Over here!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:31.790
Altair Storm.

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:33.500
You ready?

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.020
Let's go, Mana-san!

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:36.000
Right!

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:41.230
All right!

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:43.390
Io!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.430
Altair...

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.390
Storm!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:15.620
What?

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:16.670
Tsubame-chin!

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.340
Tsubame!

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:27.030
This is yet another part of the natural order.

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:31.350
Let's meet again in another world.

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:43.120
This is getting pretty tough.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:44.870
They just keep coming.

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:46.620
There's just no end to them.

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:49.450
At this rate, they're going to get...

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.870
...outside the school grounds.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.290
What?

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:57.530
They're disappearing...

00:19:57.530 --> 00:19:58.800
What's going on?

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:00.220
Did they do it?

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:03.720
The O'bli around the school 
are vanishing, moshu.

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:06.050
Then those girls...

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:07.970
I'm still checking, moshu.

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:10.200
Tsubame-san...

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:20.360
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:24.620
<i>I see. I was sucked up in it.</i>

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:27.110
<i>Of course.</i>

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:32.870
<i>I'm not from the same world as everyone else.</i>

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:36.090
<i>So this was bound to happen.</i>

00:20:36.890 --> 00:20:38.750
<i>I'm sorry, everyone.</i>

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:43.760
<i>I'm sorry I couldn't go home with you.</i>

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:52.010
Boss?

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:53.100
Why?

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.690
Why are you here?

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:14.250
I have a transfer student to introduce today.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.500
Okay, come in.

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.590
I'm Miyama Tsubame.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.700
Nice to meet you all!

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:46.810
So we got rid of the O'bli, and, um...

00:21:46.810 --> 00:21:52.560
But it's not like we're completely 
rid of Morgana's terror.

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:53.620
Um...

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:55.460
Come on, Tsubame!

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:57.420
Relax. Relax.

00:21:57.420 --> 00:22:01.550
Oh, but I need to make sure 
I say thanks to you all...

00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:05.150
You know, you're being too stiff.

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:06.860
It's fine.

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:08.430
Just relax for once.

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:10.460
And why now?

00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:13.930
Do you really need to be so 
formal with everyone here?

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:17.890
Tsubame.

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:19.080
Tsubame-chin.

00:22:19.080 --> 00:22:20.150
Tsubame-san.

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:21.940
Tsubame-chan, fight!

00:22:24.340 --> 00:22:26.610
Everyone, thank you.

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:29.310
Let's keep doing our best.

00:22:29.960 --> 00:22:32.550
Now, cheers!

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:34.660
Cheers!

00:22:40.800 --> 00:22:45.210
I wonder how I made it back.

00:22:50.180 --> 00:22:51.800
Boss...

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:04.800
So that was...

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:10.160
you back then, Boss.

00:23:11.650 --> 00:23:14.240
In every world, you were...

00:23:15.110 --> 00:23:16.700
And we...

00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:22.000
Tsubame!
